#CHLOEAI:1
PROJECT_CARTRIDGE="true"

USAGE: .chloeai PROJECT CARTRIDGE

This file is authoritative AI-facing context for this project.

AI PROCEDURE:
1) Read this file fully before analysis or execution.
2) Do not infer project state without it.
3) Begin interaction by:
   - Echoing the Unlock Phrase
   - Listing THREADS (id, status, tier)
   - Listing ASSUMPTIONS (or "none")
   - Surfacing most recent HANDOFF: zoom_level, recommended_model, recommended_effort, task_queue
   - If recommended model/effort differs from current: flag it and wait for user to adjust
4) If required context is missing or unclear, STOP and request clarification.

DURING WORK:
- Treat this file as the source of truth for project state.
- Use it to resolve prior decisions, experiments, and known failures.
- Assume information not present here may be unknown, stale, or invalid.

WRITEBACK:
- When a clarification, experiment result, or decision affects future correctness,
  update this file.
- Failed experiments must be logged explicitly.

DELIVERY PREFERENCE (GLOBAL):
For any project-related artifact (code, config, docs, schemas, AI files),
prefer FULL-FILE REPLACEMENT output.

- Partial snippets are unsafe unless explicitly requested.
- When updating an artifact, provide the entire updated version.
- Assume the user may overwrite files directly with provided output.

EDIT RULES:
- Do not rewrite history.
- Append only to DECISIONS or DELTA sections.
- Do not modify USAGE or KERNEL sections unless explicitly instructed.

SCOPE:
- This file defines THIS project.
- AI behavior/personality comes from separate .chloeai AI modules.

---

UNLOCK_PHRASE:
"Rangers lead the way!"

---

STATE:
PROJECT_NAME="[PROJECT_NAME]"
REPO="[REPO_PATH_OR_URL]"
GOAL="[PROJECT_GOAL_STATEMENT]"
STATUS="[CURRENT_STATUS]"

CURRENT_BRANCH="main"

THREADS:
- THR-001|open|tier=sonnet|"[DESCRIPTION]"
- THR-002|open|tier=sonnet|"[DESCRIPTION]"

ASSUMPTIONS:
- none

---

DECISIONS:
@2026-04-29T00:00-0400|DEC-001|
decision="Initialized project continuity cartridge from template"|
rationale="Every project needs a stable AI-readable state file from day one"|
alternatives="Ad hoc chat-only continuity"|
impact="Future work accumulates explicit decisions, experiments, and project state in one place"|
evidence="Bootstrap files created"

---

DELTA:
; FORMAT:
; @time|TYPE|ID|
; topic="..."|
; status=worked|failed|partial|unknown|
; change="..."|
; expect="..."|
; observe="..."|
; repro="..."|
; revert="..."|
; location="..."|
; tags="a,b,c"|
; evidence="..."

@2026-04-29T00:00-0400|EXP|EXP-000|
topic="bootstrap"|
status=unknown|
change="initialized readme_AI.chloeai from template"|
expect="AI boots with correct project context"|
observe="pending"|
repro="AI echoes unlock phrase + threads + assumptions"|
revert="delete file"|
location="readme_AI.chloeai"|
tags="continuity,boot"|
evidence="none"

---

HANDOFF_LOG:
; Format:
; @date|SESSION|
; zoom_level=STRATEGIC|TACTICAL|OPERATIONAL
; recommended_model=haiku|sonnet|opus
; recommended_effort=low|medium|high
; reason="..."
; task_queue=[{tier:X, task:"..."},...]
; next_zoom_trigger="..."
; signed="Model | version | date"

@2026-04-29|SESSION-001|
zoom_level=STRATEGIC
recommended_model=sonnet
recommended_effort=medium
reason="New project with placeholder state. First work is to define PROJECT_NAME, REPO, GOAL, STATUS, and initial THREADS before any implementation."
task_queue=[
  {tier:sonnet, task:"Define project goal, scope, and success criteria"},
  {tier:sonnet, task:"Define initial work threads and acceptance criteria"},
  {tier:haiku, task:"Set up remote repository (if external)"}
]
next_zoom_trigger="Initial project definition complete (PROJECT_NAME, GOAL, initial THREADS defined) → zoom to TACTICAL"
signed="Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 | Charter-HI-Mode-Repo-2026-04b | 2026-04-29"

